                <pb facs="0584" n="500" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg500"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Choate to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-05-20"><hi rendition="#italic">May 20,
                        1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Choate telegraphs the Secretary of State that he is urging that Commission
                    meet on September 3 to hear or arrange for early oral argument; and
                    Attorney-General suggesting that time might be required for production of
                    papers, he has said that he would do all he could to facilitate the production
                    of papers without formal proceedings.</p>
            </div>
